This is the last part of the analysis preparing select proteins for alphafold, finding best models, plotting, and preparing models for foldseek search.

01: Prepare Alphafold jobs
01_prepare_mature_heme_jobs.py: Extracts selected protein family representatives and creates .json Alphafold-jobs with heme C ligands included.

02: Best Model
02_extract_best_models.py: Extracts best Alphafold models from the Alphafold data.

03: Audit QC
03_audit_alphafold_sources.py: Audits the Alphafold models.

04: Manifest
04_build_standard_structure_manifest.py: Build a standardized Alphafold model structure manifest.

05: Comparative statistics
05_run_usalign_comparisons.py: Calculates TM-score and RMSD between reference proteins and other representatives.

06: Final plot manifest
06_build_final_plot_manifest.py: Collect all needed data for the final protein figures.

07: Render individual protein panels
07_render_standardized_holo_structures.py: Renders protein models with heme C ligands using PYMOL.

08: Assembly
08_assemble_standardized_structure_figure.py: Assembles all the rendered panels into figures.

09: Foldseek
09_prepare_foldseek_jobs.py: Prepares best alphafold models for Foldseek as .cif.
